      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "content": "Emily Crane Chadbourne (1871–1964; born Emily Crane; also Mrs. Thomas Chadbourne), Chicago and Stone Ridge, NY, by 1956; given to the Art Institute of Chicago, 1956.",
      "classified_as": [
        {
